 143:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c **** 
 144:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****       (+) __HAL_SAI_ENABLE(): Enable the SAI peripheral
 145:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****       (+) __HAL_SAI_DISABLE(): Disable the SAI peripheral
 146:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****       (+) __HAL_SAI_ENABLE_IT(): Enable the specified SAI interrupts
 147:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****       (+) __HAL_SAI_DISABLE_IT(): Disable the specified SAI interrupts
 148:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****       (+) __HAL_SAI_GET_IT_SOURCE(): Check if the specified SAI interrupt source is
 149:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****           enabled or disabled
 150:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****       (+) __HAL_SAI_GET_FLAG(): Check whether the specified SAI flag is set or not
 151:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c **** 
 152:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****     *** Callback registration ***
 153:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****     =============================
 154:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****     [..]
 155:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****     The compilation define USE_HAL_SAI_REGISTER_CALLBACKS when set to 1
 156:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****     allows the user to configure dynamically the driver callbacks.
 157:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****     Use functions HAL_SAI_RegisterCallback() to register a user callback.
 158:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c **** 
 159:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****     [..]
 160:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****     Function HAL_SAI_RegisterCallback() allows to register following callbacks:
 161:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****       (+) RxCpltCallback     : SAI receive complete.
 162:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****       (+) RxHalfCpltCallback : SAI receive half complete.
 163:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****       (+) TxCpltCallback     : SAI transmit complete.
 164:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****       (+) TxHalfCpltCallback : SAI transmit half complete.
 165:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****       (+) ErrorCallback      : SAI error.
 166:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****       (+) MspInitCallback    : SAI MspInit.
 167:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****       (+) MspDeInitCallback  : SAI MspDeInit.
 168:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****     [..]
 169:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****     This function takes as parameters the HAL peripheral handle, the callback ID
 170:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****     and a pointer to the user callback function.
 171:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c **** 
 172:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****     [..]
 173:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****     Use function HAL_SAI_UnRegisterCallback() to reset a callback to the default
 174:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****     weak function.
 175:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****     HAL_SAI_UnRegisterCallback() takes as parameters the HAL peripheral handle,
 176:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****     and the callback ID.
 177:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****     [..]
 178:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****     This function allows to reset following callbacks:
 179:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****       (+) RxCpltCallback     : SAI receive complete.
 180:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****       (+) RxHalfCpltCallback : SAI receive half complete.
 181:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****       (+) TxCpltCallback     : SAI transmit complete.
 182:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****       (+) TxHalfCpltCallback : SAI transmit half complete.
 183:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****       (+) ErrorCallback      : SAI error.
 184:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****       (+) MspInitCallback    : SAI MspInit.
 185:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****       (+) MspDeInitCallback  : SAI MspDeInit.
 186:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c **** 
 187:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****     [..]
 188:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****     By default, after the HAL_SAI_Init and if the state is HAL_SAI_STATE_RESET
 189:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****     all callbacks are reset to the corresponding legacy weak functions:
 190:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****     examples HAL_SAI_RxCpltCallback(), HAL_SAI_ErrorCallback().
 191:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****     Exception done for MspInit and MspDeInit callbacks that are respectively
 192:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****     reset to the legacy weak functions in the HAL_SAI_Init
 193:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****     and HAL_SAI_DeInit only when these callbacks are null (not registered beforehand).
 194:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****     If not, MspInit or MspDeInit are not null, the HAL_SAI_Init and HAL_SAI_DeInit
 195:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****     keep and use the user MspInit/MspDeInit callbacks (registered beforehand).
 196:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c **** 
ARM GAS  C:\Users\Antonio\AppData\Local\Temp\ccmFwfsh.s 			page 5


 197:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****     [..]
 198:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****     Callbacks can be registered/unregistered in READY state only.
 199:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****     Exception done for MspInit/MspDeInit callbacks that can be registered/unregistered
 200:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****     in READY or RESET state, thus registered (user) MspInit/DeInit callbacks can be used
 201:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****     during the Init/DeInit.
 202:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****     In that case first register the MspInit/MspDeInit user callbacks
 203:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****     using HAL_SAI_RegisterCallback before calling HAL_SAI_DeInit
 204:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****     or HAL_SAI_Init function.
 205:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c **** 
 206:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****     [..]
 207:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****     When the compilation define USE_HAL_SAI_REGISTER_CALLBACKS is set to 0 or
 208:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****     not defined, the callback registering feature is not available
 209:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****     and weak callbacks are used.
 210:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c **** 
 211:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****   @endverbatim
 212:../../STM32Cube_FW_N6/Drivers/STM32N6xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32n6xx_hal_sai.c ****   */
